---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
    title="Milestone Celebrations at Himaya Garden | Tucson"
    description="Private celebration venue in Tucson for birthdays, anniversaries, reunions, and meaningful milestones. Beautiful garden setting with thoughtful hospitality."
>
    <main>
        <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top,_rgba(132,147,118,0.18),_transparent_58%)]"></div>
            <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Milestone celebrations</p>
                        <h1 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-light leading-none text-charcoal">
                            Mark the moments that matter.
                        </h1>
                        <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            From milestone birthdays and anniversaries to reunions and family celebrations, Himaya Garden is a place where important moments are honored with warmth, beauty, and intention.
                        </p>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-3 mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                            <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Plan Your Celebration</a>
                            <a href="/events" class="btn-secondary">See Available Dates</a>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-4 mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-8 text-sm text-charcoal">
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">10-150</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Guest capacity</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Flexible</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Timing options</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-sage">Personal</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 text-stone">Menu creation</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fade-in delay-2 overflow-hidden rounded-sm shadow-lg">
                        <img src="/media/img/celebration.png" alt="Celebration gathering in the garden" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">Why choose Himaya for milestones</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        A venue that honors what you're celebrating.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <article class="fade-in border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">🎂</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Intimate yet spacious</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            Whether it's 10 people or 100, the garden spaces flex to fit your group while maintaining a sense of closeness and connection.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="fade-in delay-1 border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">✨</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Already beautiful</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            No need for heavy décor or complicated setups. The garden is already the backdrop — you just bring the people and the joy.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="fade-in delay-2 border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7 rounded-sm">
                        <div class="mb-4 text-3xl">💝</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Thoughtful service</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">
                            We take care of the details so you're free to be present with the people you're celebrating with.
                        </p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2">
                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Celebration types</p>
                        <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-charcoal">
                            Every milestone deserves a beautiful gathering.
                        </h2>
                        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            <p>
                                We've hosted milestone birthdays, anniversaries, family reunions, graduations, and all the celebrations in between. Each one is unique because each one is yours.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid gap-6">
                        <div class="fade-in border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Milestone birthdays</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">30, 40, 50 and beyond</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Honor the years with the people who matter most in a setting that feels meaningful.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-1 border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Anniversaries</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Celebrating love over time</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Intimate gatherings to commemorate years of partnership and togetherness.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="fade-in delay-2 border border-sage/10 bg-warm-white p-6 rounded-sm">
                            <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sage">Family reunions</p>
                            <h3 class="mt-3 font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Gather the clan</h3>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">A place for large family gatherings where multiple generations connect and celebrate together.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-warm-white py-20 md:py-24">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                    <p class="section-label fade-in">How it works</p>
                    <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light text-charcoal">
                        From conversation to celebration.
                    </h2>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
                    <div class="fade-in rounded-sm border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7">
                        <div class="mb-4 font-serif text-4xl text-sage">01</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Explore</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Walk the garden, chat about your vision, understand the space and flow for your celebration.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-1 rounded-sm border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7">
                        <div class="mb-4 font-serif text-4xl text-sage">02</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Customize</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">Design your menu, timing, and flow. We shape every element around what you're celebrating.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fade-in delay-2 rounded-sm border border-sage/10 bg-cream p-7">
                        <div class="mb-4 font-serif text-4xl text-sage">03</div>
                        <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">Celebrate</h3>
                        <p class="mt-3 text-stone leading-relaxed">We handle the logistics. You focus on the people, the memories, and the joy of the moment.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-32">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] items-center">
                    <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-sm">
                        <img src="/media/img/AG1_4.jpg" alt="Gathering celebration" class="h-full w-full object-cover" />
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <p class="section-label fade-in">Your menu</p>
                        <h2 class="fade-in delay-1 font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light leading-tight text-charcoal">
                            Food rooted in care and culture.
                        </h2>
                        <p class="fade-in delay-2 mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone">
                            Choose from Filipino-inspired menus that reflect heritage and warmth, or fully custom menus shaped around your tastes and celebration theme.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-stone">
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Heritage menus or fully customized options</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Dietary accommodations</li>
                            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-sage">◈</span> Beverage selections and toasts</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="relative overflow-hidden py-32 md:py-40 text-center text-white">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
                <img src="/media/img/hero-image.webp" alt="Celebration moment" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
            </div>
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-charcoal/50 z-[1]"></div>
            <div class="relative z-[2] max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20 xl:px-32">
                <p class="section-label text-white/80 fade-in">Ready to celebrate?</p>
                <h2 class="fade-in font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light leading-tight mb-6">
                    Let's create a milestone moment.
                </h2>
                <p class="fade-in delay-1 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed mb-8 text-white/80">
                    Connect with us to explore dates, discuss your vision, and plan a celebration that honors what you're marking.
                </p>
                <div class="fade-in delay-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Plan Your Celebration</a>
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-charcoal">Request Information</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
